  + [support_gap_closed] is P2 fixture and validation oracle plan not yet accepted
  + [support_gap_remaining] is no fixture source files are authorized
  + [support_gap_remaining] is no expected ledgers are authorized
  + [support_gap_remaining] is no validation implementation is authorized
  + [support_gap_remaining] is no storage, dependency, adapter, dispatch, operations-control, or live-control work is authorized

& [RequirementDelta: P2-S05] is the requirement delta after fixture oracle plan acceptance
  + [requirement_added] is future fixtures must expose fixture_case_id record_kind natural_key natural_key_state authority_class effect_boundary currentness_state source refs lineage review gate invalidation refs storage boundary expected status fault kind repair route and nonpromotion assertion
